{"unit_id":"TianYa-DAO__dsh-pinned-sessions#card-zh","repo":"TianYa-DAO/dsh-pinned-sessions","commit":"721b08483d0db716a59d4d96949c20dca4d1cb02","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Pinned sessions（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在侧栏顶部展示全局置顶的会话和工作区，以及运行中、待查看和当前打开的会话。用户可从菜单置顶项目、折叠工作区分组并直接打开会话，也可在通用设置中关闭置顶区。偏好保存在客户端 store，不需要 API 密钥，适合需要快速回到活跃会话的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:224-303","client.js:911-977"]}
{"unit_id":"TianYa-DAO__dsh-pinned-sessions#card-en","repo":"TianYa-DAO/dsh-pinned-sessions","commit":"721b08483d0db716a59d4d96949c20dca4d1cb02","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Pinned sessions adds pinned sessions and workspaces, running and unread sessions, and the open session to the DSH Web sidebar. Pin items from menus, collapse workspace groups, and open sessions directly. Settings can disable the section; preferences persist in the client store. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:224-303","client.js:911-977"]}
