{"unit_id":"TianYa-DAO__dsh-pinned-sessions#feature-1","repo":"TianYa-DAO/dsh-pinned-sessions","commit":"721b08483d0db716a59d4d96949c20dca4d1cb02","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Pinned sessions 的功能「状态会话分组」：按运行中、完成待查看、当前打开的状态，在侧栏顶部显示会话分组；每个会话按优先级进入一个组，组内按最近更新排序。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:281-303"]}
{"unit_id":"TianYa-DAO__dsh-pinned-sessions#feature-2","repo":"TianYa-DAO/dsh-pinned-sessions","commit":"721b08483d0db716a59d4d96949c20dca4d1cb02","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Pinned sessions 的功能「会话全局置顶」：从会话菜单全局置顶或取消置顶；置顶会话在侧栏专属分组中显示，折叠该组时会回到状态分组。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:268-287","client.js:963-969"]}
{"unit_id":"TianYa-DAO__dsh-pinned-sessions#feature-3","repo":"TianYa-DAO/dsh-pinned-sessions","commit":"721b08483d0db716a59d4d96949c20dca4d1cb02","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Pinned sessions 的功能「工作区置顶」：将工作区显示为侧栏顶部的可折叠分组，并可从分组中打开会话；置顶期间原工作区组会从下方列表隐藏。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:306-315","client.js:688-722"]}
{"unit_id":"TianYa-DAO__dsh-pinned-sessions#feature-4","repo":"TianYa-DAO/dsh-pinned-sessions","commit":"721b08483d0db716a59d4d96949c20dca4d1cb02","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Pinned sessions 的功能「持久化与开关」：在设置页关闭或开启置顶区；会话和工作区置顶偏好保存在共享客户端 store 中。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:911-938","client.js:971-977"]}
